    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Paw Party: Your AI-Powered Party Playground!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paw Party is an AI-powered social party game community. Here, players can enjoy online gatherings and play tabletop games not only with real friends but also with AI companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Unmatched Social Gaming with AI Companions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Paw Party</i>, you can enjoy a unique experience playing party games and online tabletop games with lively AI companions. These AI friends bring warmth, understanding, and energy, creating a social dynamic like no other. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- A more authentic AI companionship experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our AI NPCs are more than just sidekicks; they\u2019re your pets and companions. Chat with them, deepen your bond, and enjoy a friend who\u2019s there for you anytime, anywhere, making every game feel special!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>AI-Generated Challenges and Comments, Surprises at Every Turn!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957820/extras/23e8af05714bba2af7ebf395e872cd56.poster.avif?t=1751806030\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957820/extras/23e8af05714bba2af7ebf395e872cd56.webm?t=1751806030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957820/extras/23e8af05714bba2af7ebf395e872cd56.mp4?t=1751806030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vi